# React UI — always use the project skill

Before writing or refactoring UI in `apps/web`, read and follow `.cursor/skills/react-best-practices/SKILL.md`.

That skill is the Vercel/aitmpl React performance rule set (waterfalls, bundles, re-renders, rendering, JS). Load `references/react-performance-guidelines.md` for the category you are touching and `references/farmaplus-web.md` for this repo's folders.

## Non-negotiables

- Split pages, components, hooks, utils, and API. Do not grow god-files.
- Business formulas belong in `@farmaplus/domain`, not in React components.
- Import modules directly (no new barrel `index.ts` files).
- Keep Tailwind, submit spinners, and mobile layout. Do not change product behavior.
- Skip Next.js-only APIs unless this app actually uses Next.js.
